  relicText: {fileID: 1709878624}
  passage: '"The ancient Filipinos ran to the ocean while banging their pots and
    pans and shouted together, ''Return our moon!''. Bakunawa was so startled by
    the loud sudden noise that it spat out the seventh moon."'
