  relicText: {fileID: 1709878624}
  passage: "\"Bakunawa sprung from the pitch-black ocean and bolted towards the sky\u2014he
    opened his mouth as wide as he could around one of the moons and with one powerful
    swoop, swallowed it whole. As he did so, a huge wave of earthquake shook the
    ancient land of Philippines.\""
